NCSA Mosaic V2.7-4b3 runs on VMS (both VAX and Alpha) just fine.

>The second question deals with having an application submit e-mail to
>the internet.  What programs are involved, where do you get them, or is
>there a syntax under MAIL> that will submit them automatically?

