The entire debate on the number of lines of characters (and even the number
of characters on a line) is totally irrelevant when talking about video
tubes.  The only things the monitors care about are scan lines and pels/
line, refresh rates, and the like:  that is, video inputs.  How these are
translated into characters is a video controller issue, not a monitor issue.

