controller, Win31's RGDI/GAI.SYS display drivers running 1280x1024x256 on 
the DEC VR320 20" color monitor.  Runs fine, looks great <g>.

All the above show quite clearly in the System Properties - Device Manager 
tab, available after a Right Mouse click on My Computer and selecting the 
Properties menu item.  

