***********************************************************
   IX INTERNATIONAL SYMPOSIUM ON ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE

                        Call for Papers   
                           ISAI/IFIS   
             http://www-cia.mty.itesm.mx/isai/isai.html 
    
  Industrial Fuzzy Control and  
  Intelligent Systems:  
                                                                  
  Mexico-USA Collaboration in
  Intelligent Systems Technologies


  November 12-15, 1996
  Sheraton Cancun Resort & Towers

  Cancun, Mexico

************************************************************

The Ninth International Symposium on Artificial 
Intelligence in joint cooperation with the Sixth 
International Conference on Industrial Fuzzy Control 
& Intelligent Systems will be held in Cancun, Mexico 
on November 12-15, 1996.

Papers from all countries are sought that 
(1) Present applications of artificial intelligence 
technology to the solution of problems in industry, 
business and related areas; 
(2) Address the issue of transferring AI Technology; 
(3) Describe research on innovative AI techniques 
to accomplish such applications (theoretical papers 
will be considered).
 

Areas of application include but are not limited to:
manufacturing, automation, control  systems, planning, 
design, production, distribution, marketing, human 
resources, finance, stock exchange, international 
business, environmental control, underwriting, legal 
aspects, communication media, decision support, 
digital system design.

Technology transfer includes but is not limited to:
strategies for introducing and institutionalizing 
AI technology, human resources development in AI, 
justification of AI projects, cooperation programs, 
sociotechnical impact of AI technology.

AI techniques include but are not limited to:
knowledge-based systems, expert systems, neural 
networks, fuzzy systems, genetic algorithms, 
automated reasoning, computer vision, robotics, 
natural language, cognitive systems, multimedia, 
knowledge engineering, computer-human interfaces, 
machine learning, knowledge representation.


