>How can I randomly access tapes in my TLZ7L?

Get a copy of the Media Robot Utility.  The part numbers for the
licenses are:

QM-50TAA-AA - Software only ($249 US)
QM-50TAA-SA - Software and media ($299 US)

Alternatively, get a backup software package that licenses use
of the Medium Changer driver or provides their own.  You may
find software on the net that uses the Medium Changer driver,
but it probably doesn't license the use of it.  You may also
find software which uses the SCSI CAM User Agent.  It doesn't
need a license.

